          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li#Ca12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Olivia+Caramello"}> Olivia Caramello
                ,
                %em Atomic toposes and countable categoricity
                , Appl. Cat. Struc.
                %strong 20
                no. 4 (2012) pp.379-391. (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0811.3547"}> arXiv:0811.3547
                )
            %li#Ca16
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Olivia+Caramello"}> Olivia Caramello
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.oliviacaramello.com/Unification/HDROliviaCaramello.pdf"}
                    %em Grothendieck toposes as unifying ‘bridges’ in Mathematics
